Foundation-ന്റെ ഇരുവശത്തും rank-ിൽ നിന്ന് gate gap നിർമ്മിച്ച് signed direction അനുസരിച്ച് കൂട്ടുകയോ കുറയ്ക്കുകയോ ചെയ്യുന്ന Stage 1 no-wrap fixture. rank `1..922` ആണെങ്കിൽ gap `41+rank`, അതായത് `42..963`.

Hamlet, Foundation day സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, positive side rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, negative side rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, positive gap സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, negative gap സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, gate plus one സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, gate minus one സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input-output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: inputs.

Scene I: Foundation, positive rank, negative rank വായിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act II: gaps and signed gates.

Scene I: positive gap = 41 + rank.
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 You are as good as Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: negative gap = 41 + rank.
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: gate +1 and gate -1.
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of Hamlet and Othello.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and Macbeth.
[Exeunt]

Act III: outputs.

Scene I: positive പിന്നെ negative gate.
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
